# ---- Phase 4.1 seal state ----------------------------------------------------
# The recorded hash is tracked; the access log and freeze are run-time state that
# must be visible to anyone auditing the run, so both are tracked too. Only the
# crash-time backup of the preflight-incident log is ignored.
eval/seal/access.log.preflight-incident
models/
hf_dataset/
brag-output/
logs/